<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="31356499"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1445308966"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Waiting For Love (Live)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Avicii / Martin Garrix / Simon Aldred"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Waiting For Love"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:33.803"><div begin="00:39.774" end="03:22.690"><p begin="00:39.774" end="00:43.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13048">Where there's a will, there's a way, kinda beautiful<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而每个追梦人来说 我们无法阻挡他们梦想的步伐</span></p><p begin="00:43.293" end="00:46.395" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13049">And every night has it's day, so magical<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为那梦带着坚定的信仰</span></p><p begin="00:46.755" end="00:49.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13050">And if there's love in this life, there's no obstacle<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期一我被无情地击败</span></p><p begin="00:50.198" end="00:53.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13051">That can't be defeated<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周二的我 怀揣一丝希望</span></p><p begin="00:53.501" end="00:56.638" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13052">For every tyrant, a tear for the vulnerable<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期三我张开双臂</span></p><p begin="00:56.767" end="00:59.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13053">In every lot soul, the bones of a miracle<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期四等待爱，等待爱的到来</span></p><p begin="01:00.231" end="01:03.334" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13054">For every dreamer, a dream we're unstoppable</p><p begin="01:03.701" end="01:06.994" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13055">With something to believe in<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">繁星璀璨 周五了</span></p><p begin="01:07.649" end="01:10.048" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13056">Monday left me broken<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期日我将不会去祷告</span></p><p begin="01:10.058" end="01:13.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13057">Tuesday, I was through with hopin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暗想我才不会周日去教堂</span></p><p begin="01:13.403" end="01:16.606" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13058">Wednesday, my empty arms were open<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在等待爱 等待爱</span></p><p begin="01:16.865" end="01:20.759" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13059">Thursday, waitin' for love, waitin' for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待爱降临</span></p><p begin="01:21.062" end="01:23.364" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13060">Thank the stars it's Friday</p><p begin="01:23.374" end="01:26.838" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13061">I'm burnin' like a fire, gone wild on Saturday</p><p begin="01:26.848" end="01:30.178" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13062">Guess I won't be comin' to church on Sunday</p><p begin="01:30.404" end="01:34.297" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13063">I'll be waitin' for love, waitin' for love</p><p begin="01:34.325" end="01:43.502" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13064">To come around, come around, come around, come around, come around</p><p begin="01:46.408" end="01:48.489" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15103">Come around</p><p begin="02:14.854" end="02:17.557" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13065">We are one of a kind, irreplaceable</p><p begin="02:18.139" end="02:20.947" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13066">How did I get so blind and so cynical?</p><p begin="02:21.499" end="02:24.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13067">If there's love in this life, we're unstoppable</p><p begin="02:24.756" end="02:28.059" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13068">No, we can't be defeated<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">残酷的暴徒也会为可怜之人流下眼泪</span></p><p begin="02:28.623" end="02:31.126" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13069">Monday left me broken<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个迷失的灵魂里 都蕴藏着奇迹的可能</span></p><p begin="02:31.178" end="02:34.371" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13070">Tuesday, I was through with hopin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每一个梦想家都有无法阻挡的梦想</span></p><p begin="02:34.549" end="02:37.752" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13071">Wednesday, my empty arms were open<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有真诚的信仰</span></p><p begin="02:38.071" end="02:41.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13072">Thursday, waitin' for love, waitin' for love</p><p begin="02:42.344" end="02:44.529" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13073">Thank the stars it's Friday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星期二我就在希望中复活</span></p><p begin="02:44.596" end="02:47.899" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13074">I'm burnin' like a fire gone wild on Saturday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周二的我 怀揣一丝希望</span></p><p begin="02:48.087" end="02:51.291" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13075">Guess I won't be comin' to church on Sunday<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周三的我 展开空空如也的双臂</span></p><p begin="02:51.625" end="02:55.328" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13076">I'll be waitin' for love, waitin' for love<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周四的我还在等待爱 等待爱</span></p><p begin="02:55.499" end="02:57.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13077">To come around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">繁星璀璨 周五了</span></p><p begin="02:58.919" end="03:01.221" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13078">To come around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">周六的我像是燃烧的烈焰 肆意疯狂</span></p><p begin="03:02.233" end="03:04.568" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13079">To come around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">暗想我才不会周日去教堂</span></p><p begin="03:05.629" end="03:08.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13080">To come around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还在等待爱 等待爱</span></p><p begin="03:08.928" end="03:20.928" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13081">To come around (Come around, come around, come around, come around)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等待爱的降临</span></p><p begin="03:21.038" end="03:22.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17309">Come around</p></div></body></tt>